## Finishing

{{#if completion.explicitCall}}
When the work is complete, call the `{{completion.finishName}}` tool with a short
summary of what you did to end the run. **A reply with no tool call does not end the
run** — in this run it is treated as an error. Keep working by calling tools, and end
only by calling `{{completion.finishName}}`.
{{else}}
When the work is complete, reply with a message and no tool calls; that ends the run.
As long as you keep calling tools, the run continues.
{{/if}}
{{#if completion.validated}}

Before your completion is accepted, gg runs the following validation command(s), and
the run only ends if every one succeeds. If any fails, its output is returned to you
and the run continues so you can fix the problem and finish again:

{{#each completion.validation}}
- `{{this}}`
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

